 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-m6",
  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "draft_py": "# Celestial Armor (FDN), an Equipment with flash for {2}{W}.\n# \"Flash\"                                                   compiled keyword, kept\n# \"When this Equipment enters, attach it to target creature you control.\"   compiled [0], kept\n# \"That creature gains hexproof and indestructible until end of turn.\"       mapped here\n# \"Equipped creature gets +2/+0 and has flying.\"            compiled [1] (B11-attached-pt), kept\n# \"Equip {3}{W}\"                                            compiled [2] (B5a-equip), kept\n# The unparsed sentence continues the enters trigger: its effect becomes a Seq of the compiled\n#   ATTACH, then M21 Heroic Intervention's verified \"gain hexproof and indestructible until end of\n#   turn\" (two GRANT_ABILITY with DurationEot, sorted by name per D23 and printed order alike).\n#   \"That creature\" is the trigger's target: ZNR Shell Shield's verified \"that creature also gains\n#   hexproof until end of turn\" (a referent 'target' Selector), so the grant reaches the targeted\n#   creature even when the Equipment has left before the trigger resolves (only the attach then\n#   does nothing).\nattach = compiled[0]\nthat_creature = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.ANY, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n    referent='target',\n)\nenters = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=attach.event,\n    condition=None,\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            attach.effect,\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.HEXPROOF),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': that_creature,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.INDESTRUCTIBLE),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': that_creature,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [enters, *compiled[1:]]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Flash",
    "ir": "keywords[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "When this Equipment enters, attach it to target creature you control.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[0] (the compiled enters trigger's ATTACH)"
   },
   {
    "clause": "That creature gains hexproof and indestructible until end of turn.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[1], abilities[0].effect.steps[2] (referent 'target', until end of turn)"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Equipped creature gets +2/+0 and has flying.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Equip {3}{W}",
    "ir": "abilities[2]; keywords[0]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "The compiled enters trigger keeps its ATTACH; M21 Heroic Intervention's hexproof and indestructible until end of turn on 'that creature', ZNR Shell Shield's referent 'target' (verified), so the grants stand when the attach fails (CR 701.3b). The probe shows them wear off at end of turn. Pack: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/celestial_armor_creature_protected_even_if_the_armor_left.json."
 },
